(* ENGINEERING_CONTRACT
  RUNNING_COUNT: clamped demand; output each scan; 0..5 (PUB001,S1,S5).
  LEAD_PUMP: demand=0 clears; positive initial on prev_lead=0 chooses min (hours,pump).
